ross-references.\n\n\"Roget’s II: New Thesaurus from Enfour offers the best value for features and content.\"\n\"Roget’s II stands out as a clear choice for anyone who needs both quality content and rich features.\"\n-MacWorld (Kate Dohe) \"4 mice\"\n\nRoget’s II: The New Thesaurus, Third Edition published by Houghton Mifflin Harcourt Publishing Company. All rights reserved.  \n\nHoughton Mifflin Harcourt Publishing Company\nhttp://www.hmco.com/\n___________________\n\nPowered by Enfour Inc's \"UniDict® Engine 16\"\n\nWorks with these \"UniDict®\" dictionaries from Enfour:\n  American Heritage Dictionary\n  Oxford Dictionary of English\n  Australian Oxford Dictionary\n  Longman Dictionary of Contemporary English\n  Longman English-Japanese Dictionary\nand many more...", "userRatingCount": 12}]}